WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.340
By my own count, I've failed at
nine of the ten things I've tried.

2
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.160
In my twenties I started a
digital advertising agency.

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.430
I thought it would do very well.

4
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:11.980
It didn't work out.

5
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.330
But I never told myself
I'd never use it again.

6
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.350
Even when it fails, I say,

7
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.540
it becomes part of your skill set.

8
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.600
Years later, I ran a
fishing tourism business.

9
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.140
Digital advertising was how
I got my clients to come.

10
00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.440
So here's the question.

11
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.280
What did one of your failures
give you that you still use?

